<title>HONG KONG: Liang Shing 1996 net loss HK$91.22 mln.</title>
<headline>Liang Shing 1996 net loss HK$91.22 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   31.0 loss  vs  14.9 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptionsl items	  33.88 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    91.22 loss vs  40.43 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     709.67     vs  897.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 Liang Shing (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 28 to June 3</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Liang Shing is a sport shoe maker.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for permanent diminution in value of long-term investment and writeoff of obsolete fixed assets.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs seven H.K. cents (interim dividend and special distribution).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
